; deterministic Python/Blender export. No photographic textures.","review":{"status":"pending","reviewer":null,"checks":{}},"modelingNotes":["The original triangular OSM outline and six mapped 50 m roof sectors determine the site and apex height. Two indoor shop polygons do not describe exterior roof volumes and are omitted.","The six OSM skillion tags approximate the curved shell. An original smooth barycentric vault replaces these planar sectors; its exact curvature, 0.65 m shell thickness and 2 m curtain-wall setback are explicit visual inferences.","The inspected October 1991 reference confirms the white curved concrete roof and glazed facade. Current doors, signs, interior floors and later alterations are not verified or modeled. Structural glass is light blue; mullions are schematic."],"source":{"url":"/assets/cnit/8940c83648b4e12d508d9c979071403117561bff3131e5b1a71a1017ca4756d2/source.blend.gz","bytes":140392,"sha256":"adac07077d7275bf1e10f06fd4a60b2b6adfd528fdc46b0495a8be6b274868f7"},"spatialSource":{"url":"/assets/cnit/8940c83648b4e12d508d9c979071403117561bff3131e5b1a71a1017ca4756d2/spatial-source.json","bytes":14182,"sha256":"9feb85ce490e2fd9eb6c156b2f1413df835b8d24bba2a8adcfe8ea1c456a4f03"},"preview":{"url":"/assets/cnit/8940c83648b4e12d508d9c979071403117561bff3131e5b1a71a1017ca4756d2/preview.webp","bytes":6498,"sha256":"11f5eb9621794e55019271e6ce127e102cff09e2c725c4a0a62612d4dad6fc63"},"revision":"c2388e238be4093ccf702dd6413da55eb368303cbc986fd047c2dbbcb33a348b","publicationRevision":"8940c83648b4e12d508d9c979071403117561bff3131e5b1a71a1017ca4756d2","bounds":[2.2378005,48.8918184,2.2404587,48.893752],"approved":false,"metadata":"/assets/cnit/8940c83648b4e12d508d9c979071403117561bff3131e5b1a71a1017ca4756d2/asset.json","validation":"/assets/cnit/8940c83648b4e12d508d9c979071403117561bff3131e5b1a71a1017ca4756d2/validation.json"}